#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:355
msgid "解决步骤"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:357
msgid "按以下顺序处理，每完成一步即重新编译验证；任一步骤后溢出消失即可停止："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:359
msgid "**调小块大小参数。** 将BLOCK_SIZE等块大小参数按2的幂次逐级调小（如由4096调至2048、1024），grid会随块大小自动扩大（grid = ceil(n_elements / BLOCK_SIZE)），处理的元素总量不变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:361
msgid "修改前（BLOCK_SIZE过大，触发ub overflow）："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:363
msgid "add_kernel[grid](x, y, out, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE=4096)\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:367
msgid "修改后（调小BLOCK_SIZE）："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:369
msgid "add_kernel[grid](x, y, out, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE=1024)\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:373
msgid "**for循环按序列维度分块处理长序列。** 当序列长度远大于单个tile可安全容纳的元素数时，在核函数内部用for循环按序列轴切分：load、计算、store均在循环体内完成，每次只处理BLOCK_SIZE_SUB个元素，任一时刻UB中仅驻留一个子块的数据。参数约束：BLOCK_SIZE_SUB应不大于BLOCK_SIZE，建议取2的幂次（如1024、2048）且最好能整除BLOCK_SIZE；不能整除时尾块由mask自动处理，不影响正确性。完整核函数示例如下："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:375
msgid "@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel_tiled(x_ptr, y_ptr, out_ptr, n_elements,\n"
"                    BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"    base_offset = pid * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"\n"
"    # Compute the total number of sub-blocks the current program needs to process\n"
"    num_sub_blocks = tl.cdiv(BLOCK_SIZE, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB)\n"
"\n"
"    # Loop over tiles along the sequence dimension: move/compute only BLOCK_SIZE_SUB elements at a time\n"
"    for sub_block_idx in range(num_sub_blocks):\n"
"        sub_offset = base_offset + sub_block_idx * BLOCK_SIZE_SUB\n"
"        offsets = sub_offset + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB)\n"
"        mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"        x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask, other=0)\n"
"        y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask, other=0)\n"
"        tl.store(out_ptr + offsets, x + y, mask=mask)\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:395
msgid "与触发溢出的大块写法（核函数内一次性load整个BLOCK_SIZE，如`offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)`）相比，关键差异是：分块写法把同样的数据量拆到for循环中逐子块搬运和计算，单次搬运数据量从BLOCK_SIZE降为BLOCK_SIZE_SUB。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:397
msgid "**关闭multi-buffer存算并行。** 若调小块大小后仍溢出，可在autotune配置中设置`multibuffer=False`关闭多缓冲（对应编译器侧默认开启的`multiBuffer=True`配置），减少张量副本带来的额外local buffer占用："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:399
msgid "@triton.autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 1024}, multibuffer=False),\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 2048}, multibuffer=False),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=['n_elements'],\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr, y_ptr, out_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"    offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"    x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    tl.store(out_ptr + offsets, x + y, mask=mask)\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:417
msgid "也可在kernel launch时作为meta-parameter传入："
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/programming_guide/index.md:419
msgid "add_kernel[grid](x, y, out, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE=1024, multibuffer=False)\n"
""
